 your role",id:"tVTEVxlYhS"},installPluginSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Add ready-made tools and workflows",id:"TSSIvgJO4U"},installPluginPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Hey Claude, I'm new to Cowork. Can you help me find plugins to install? First ask me what my role is if you don't already know. Afterwards, suggest some plugins that match my role and show me one I should install first.",id:"WLuiV1tqyY"},scheduleTaskTitle:{defaultMessage:"Schedule a recurring task",id:"Cs2Rf1AkqB"},scheduleTaskSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Great for reminders, reports, or regular check-ins",id:"42p5zYzhtq"},scheduleTaskPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Hey Claude, I want to try scheduling a recurring task. Can you walk me through it? Ask me if I have something regular I'd like to automate. If I can't think of anything, suggest something and help me set it up. If I haven't connected the tools you'd need yet, help me do that first.",id:"837vvR3GKV"},dailyBriefingTitle:{defaultMessage:"Create a daily briefing",id:"YgieKqhWMt"},dailyBriefingSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"A morning rundown of what's on your plate and what changed overnight",id:"IwRpAUVLU+"},dailyBriefingPrompt:{defaultMessage:"Hey Claude, I'd like a daily briefing. Help me set up a scheduled task that runs each morning and pulls together what I should know — calendar, unread messages, anything that changed overnight in my connected tools. Ask me what time and which sources to include, then schedule it.",id:"ONuJayg0Gg"},enableNotificationsTitle:{defaultMessage:"Turn on notifications",id:"IXFS1bytWQ"},enableNotificationsSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Claude can ping you when it finishes work or needs your input",id:"1sLNHR3kra"},setHotkeyTitle:{defaultMessage:"Set a global shortcut",id:"uPBNGtxydc"},setHotkeySubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Open Cowork from anywhere",id:"jMcbT6jU3G"},enableDispatchTitle:{defaultMessage:"Pair your phone",id:"VJXGlQsyZ5"},enableDispatchSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"Send tasks from your phone for Claude to run here",id:"TQbWCEnEIe"},impo